// pyo3 0.22's `#[pyfunction]` macro expansion emits an `.into()` on the
// returned `PyResult`, which clippy flags as useless. The conversion is
// real code generated by the macro — not something we can remove — so
// the allow is scoped to this file rather than crate-wide.
#![allow(clippy::useless_conversion)]

